# The Hero's last class node: twelve slashes of four lines, then five explosions
# of five, all on eight enemies. Modelled as GMS's twelve and five instead of
# one 48-line swing and one 25-line hit: the total is the same, but merging
# would misdescribe the skill, and the log would show one landing where GMS
# shows twelve.
#
# The final damage it unlocks is worth six Combo Orbs for eight seconds, and it
# starts at the cast. GMS makes the distinction in one sentence: the explosions
# come "afterwards" and the final damage "upon use". So all of this cast gets
# it, and so does everything else in the window: about 1.3 times damage on every
# swing, once every 30 seconds.
#
# Six orbs' worth, not six orbs: only an orb's final damage is raised, not the
# attack, boss damage or DEF it also gives. A Hero with no per-orb final damage
# gets nothing, which is GMS's "while Combo Attack is active" without needing a
# condition.
#
# The 660ms cast is short for a 5th job skill: the slashes and explosions play
# out after it, not during it.
name: "Sword Illusion"
description:
  "Slice forward faster than the eye can see using a combo orb. Sword "
  "Illusion is unaffected by attack reflection."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_HERO_V skill_order: 4 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_ONE_HANDED_SWORD
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_TWO_HANDED_SWORD
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_ONE_HANDED_AXE
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_TWO_HANDED_AXE
base_delay_ms: 660
cooldown_seconds: 30.0
max_enemies: 8
lines: 4
casts: 12
base { skill_pct: 1.30 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.05 }
extra_hit {
  label: "Explosion"
  lines: 5
  casts: 5
  base { skill_pct: 2.60 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.10 }
}
buff {
  duration_seconds: 8.0
  raised_on_cast: true
  base { final_dmg_combo_orbs: 6 }
}
